==Description==
The '''Noob Nametag''' is an {{Color|Uncommon}} nametag that can be bought in the daily nametag store for {{Coins|1,000}}.

The '''Noob Nametag''' has yellow text and a blue outline.

==Trivia==
*The '''Noob Nametag''' is based on the stereotypical Roblox noob, which has yellow head and arms, blue torso and green legs.

